{"title":"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 28","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_28\">Problem 28</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 28\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />, sides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/b/e9bdf3e496517e8f8742f81dd774be1f93cf6e8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> are opposite <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/8/74808e5d34e39acff8bb9245bcec87dce45251f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle{A},\\angle{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"61\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/c/c1c62e045cad256d9c4a24cb167819b32f1f3ae3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle{C}$\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" /> respectively. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> bisects <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/4/4f43bae270243d086d23357db1731f8591fcd0a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle{A}$\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> and meets <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />. \nThen if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/c/47c8b4fbc9d7a1e59a00b6c4a0fbb1e9a28d4225.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\overline{CD}$\" width=\"64\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/1/f7104f7589c6e9ef687f4c089cf9966126a729a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\overline{BD}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"64\" height=\"19\" /> the correct proportion is: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/7/9a737eaf3ed57bac72b7277d1401f63abb987b15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac {x}{a} = \\frac {a}{b + c} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac {x}{b} = \\frac {a}{a + c} \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{y}{c}=\\frac{c}{b+c}\\\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{y}{c}=\\frac{a}{b+c}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{x}{y}=\\frac{c}{b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"410\" height=\"72\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/6/70644735e3969f43bcb493aab8da8583d0a578c8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy]pair A,B,C,D; A = (5,6); B = (9,0); C = (0,0); D = (B+C)/2; draw(D--A--B--C--A); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,A,N); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,B,SW); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,C,SE);  label(&quot;$D$&quot;,D,S); label(&quot;$b$&quot;,(A+C)/2,NW); label(&quot;$c$&quot;,(B+A)/2,NE); label(&quot;$x$&quot;,(C+D)/2,S); label(&quot;$y$&quot;,(D+B)/2,S);[/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"212\" />\nBy the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Angle_Bisector_Theorem\" title=\"Angle Bisector Theorem\">Angle Bisector Theorem</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/5/725e4a69ecb580566945b6903dddcd8e38521f14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x}{b}=\\frac{y}{c}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"50\" height=\"33\" />. Because of this, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/0/7f0eb154f10c07f0434aa73442546bef04a2ccf0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x}{b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"12\" height=\"33\" /> must equal <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/b/d0b439ebab44f4dd4675dd171318d1331778ea33.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{ky}{kc}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"22\" height=\"37\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> is some real number. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/7/3b7696322fa8cce232f7b7970d316c736d844ff3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x+y}{b+c}=\\frac{y+ky}{c+kc}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"124\" height=\"39\" />. Factoring <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/9/209ac57d1bcbc0e9c99e9891fb478ad179ed53a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{k+1}{k+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"43\" height=\"39\" /> out, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/8/ad8b368a434d9462dbae7a87fc64a5c3a3ffe752.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{y}{c}=\\frac{x+y}{b+c}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"86\" height=\"39\" />. However, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/9/189e3ce6d1b3191e48b16849e0a5dcb1494f7d43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y=a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"78\" height=\"16\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/9/5f9ed9b4eec5e01e34e347c279f98e232be62751.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{y}{c}=\\frac{a}{b+c}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"113\" height=\"34\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME\" title=\"1953 AHSME\">1953 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1953 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1953\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">Problem 27</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">Problem 29</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_P